WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.107
This is Centaur.

2
00:00:02.809 --> 00:00:05.229
Every manager asks the same three questions.

3
00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.073
How much is in the pipeline?

4
00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:09.374
What will we close this quarter?

5
00:00:10.285 --> 00:00:11.694
And which deals are in trouble?

6
00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:15.501
The Pipeline summary answers all three on one screen.

7
00:00:16.137 --> 00:00:19.606
Dana can look at her own deals, her team's, or the whole company's.

8
00:00:20.528 --> 00:00:22.163
At the top are the key numbers.

9
00:00:22.936 --> 00:00:26.917
Open pipeline, new deals this week, win rate over ninety days,

10
00:00:26.917 --> 00:00:29.486
and the average number of days to close.

11
00:00:30.788 --> 00:00:33.379
Each has a small chart showing the last eight weeks,

12
00:00:33.379 --> 00:00:36.268
so she can see whether things are getting better or worse.

13
00:00:37.498 --> 00:00:40.088
Pipeline by stage shows where the value sits.

14
00:00:40.891 --> 00:00:43.233
Click a stage, and there are the deals in it.

15
00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:48.609
The quarter forecast shows what's won, what's committed and what's best case,

16
00:00:48.609 --> 00:00:50.080
against the team's target.

17
00:00:51.114 --> 00:00:53.274
With forecast automation switched on,

18
00:00:53.274 --> 00:00:58.996
Centaur keeps each deal's rating and forecast status up to date from what's happening on the deal,

19
00:00:58.996 --> 00:01:03.025
so the forecast doesn't depend on reps remembering to change a field.

20
00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:05.974
Then there's the list that matters most.

21
00:01:06.563 --> 00:01:07.772
Deals needing attention.

22
00:01:08.422 --> 00:01:09.730
A close date that's passed.

23
00:01:10.516 --> 00:01:12.528
No activity in more than two weeks.

24
00:01:13.337 --> 00:01:15.516
A deal that closes in the next few days.

25
00:01:16.455 --> 00:01:19.805
The most urgent comes first, and each one opens with a click.

26
00:01:20.928 --> 00:01:23.441
Northfield Logistics closes at the end of March.

27
00:01:24.249 --> 00:01:28.168
If it goes quiet, Dana will know before the quarter ends, not after.

28
00:01:29.156 --> 00:01:30.286
Centaur CRM.

29
00:01:30.796 --> 00:01:33.830
A forecast you can trust, without the Friday spreadsheet.

30
00:01:34.919 --> 00:01:38.980
Book a demonstration today, at centaurcrm.com.

